# ====================
# CLIENTES
# ====================

### Obtener clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clientes


### Agregar cliente
POST http://localhost:3000/api/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Prueba1",
    "telefono": "3133416546"
}


### Actualizar cliente
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/clientes/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Prueba2",
    "telefono": "3132733934"
}

### Eliminar cliente
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/clientes/6


